 462:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_dma_ex.c ****       To setup a trigger transfers, three DMA channel parameters are needed:
 463:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_dma_ex.c **** 
